  "solution": "Concept:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c233de34ec16ba59ed0f648e5524bd1adf0ff92ac82b8768787630a30395e624.png] \n\n**Calculation**\n\n95 - [144 ÷ (12 × 12) - (-4) - {3 - 17 - 10}]\n\n= 95 - [144 ÷ (12 × 12) - (-4) - {3 - 27}] \n\n= 95 - [144 ÷ 144 - (-4) - {-24)]\n\n= 95 - [1 - (-4) - (-24)] \n\n= 95 - [1 + 4 + 24] \n\n= 95 - 29 \n\n= 66\n\n**The answer is 66.**",
